#: includes/passkeys/class-atshift-freeform-login-passkey-profile.php:388
msgid ""
"Password login remains available after you register a passkey. To keep your "
"account secure, use a long, strong password that you do not reuse on other "
"services, and store it in a password manager."
msgstr ""
"Log masuk dengan kata sandi tetap tersedia setelah Anda mendaftarkan kunci "
"sandi. Untuk menjaga keamanan akun, gunakan kata sandi yang panjang dan "
"kuat, jangan gunakan kembali kata sandi tersebut di layanan lain, dan simpan "
"kata sandi tersebut di pengelola kata sandi."

